{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 680, "mtime": 1791871008.3522644, "sha256": "4abfb58c1ae6b1fe9346b662720c03a4d7f204e96fa63e1830aa9ba9048efecf"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 499, "mtime": 1791871012.0683587, "sha256": "6fe34661070bc69e9265616a02dc507a111a182dff6b0275c79967c25a42941d"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/transcripts/with/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/4/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/aa38/omp-938/cells/with/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/4/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Adding a regression test, then running.\n`round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`. I checked it by running the function directly. I couldn't run the test files because pytest isn't installed here.\n\n**Cause:** `round(x, 2)` had two problems. The float `2.675` is actually stored as `2.67499999\u2026`, so it rounds down. And Python's `round()` rounds halves to the nearest even digit, so `round(0.125, 2)` gives `0.12`. Both go against the \"half up\" promise in the docstring.\n\n**Fix** in `pricing/money.py`:\n```python\nreturn float(Decimal(repr(x)).quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP))\n```\n`repr(x)` gives the shortest decimal string that turns back into the same float, so `2.675` stays `\"2.675\"`. The function then rounds that decimal half up. It still returns a `float`, so `add_vat` and other callers don't change. Negative numbers round away from zero: `-2.675` gives `-2.68`.\n\n**Check** (direct run with `python3`):\n- `round_money` on `2.675, 0.125, 1.005, 2.674, -2.675, 3` gives `2.68, 0.13, 1.01, 2.67, -2.68, 3.0`.\n- Before the fix, `round(2.675, 2)` gave `2.67` and `round(0.125, 2)` gave `0.12`.\n- `add_vat(10.0)` gives `12.0`.\n- The existing `split(10.00, 3)` case still gives `[3.34, 3.33, 3.33]`.\n\nI added `tests/test_round_money.py` with these cases. It hasn't been run yet because pytest is missing.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 9, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 220779, "requests_cache_write": 37243, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2741708, "requests_count": 9, "requests_input_uncached": 20, "requests_output": 2186, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial4", "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 6, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T05:56:34.338101+00:00", "subagent_r